{"data": [{"author_id": "1437527618807418883", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:31:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118335431200899288"], "id": "2118335431200899288", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "rare window for Indian founders and builders: anyone in the ai companion or assistant space, you might want to build an alt to Instinct / Meta Muse.\n\nInstinct hasn't been working for a lot of indian users. Meta is planning  to launch in India.\n\nfind your usp, cater to indians.", "url": "https://x.com/r0hansarkar/status/2118335431200899288"}, {"author_id": "429179115", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:24:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118333539796263104"], "id": "2118333539796263104", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "$META Muse hits 20 million downloads in 56 days. That's 357k downloads per day.\n\nThe app is only available in the US, Canada, Japan and Singapore. 89% of downloads are from the US.", "url": "https://x.com/Apptopia/status/2118333539796263104"}, {"author_id": "106996446", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:22:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118333100241592789"], "id": "2118333100241592789", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 130, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ChatGPTとClaudeとMeta Museの3つ使うようになってMAGIシステムみたいになってきたな…\n\nMuseは、エージェント型のAIだからその点、ChatGPT GoとClaude Freeにない機能だから補え点ではある\n\n自分好みにアバター作ってしまったので、愛着度がアカンな…生成AI依存度がましてしまって、イカンな…寝よう", "url": "https://x.com/s_gushi/status/2118333100241592789"}, {"author_id": "1243541134355435527", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:16:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118331622177354150"], "id": "2118331622177354150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "muse招待コード: 9QXXFK\nhttps://t.co/zZj43nl5ib\n\n残り1枠あります✌️\n\n9QXXFK\n\n #Meta #Muse招待コード #Muse\n\nリプライもご自由にどうぞ！", "url": "https://x.com/okeokepi/status/2118331622177354150"}, {"author_id": "1770935230452375552", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:12:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118330618576576589"], "id": "2118330618576576589", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1689268680264138752", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118009143131013263", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CyberFarmerX meta muse", "url": "https://x.com/__KumR__/status/2118330618576576589"}, {"author_id": "152694476", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:11:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118330357217165656"], "id": "2118330357217165656", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1974377077345247232", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118329354870554802", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@EmmanuelInvest I agree with your point , but when your customers are $GOOGL $AMZN etc , a minor spend of theirs is equivalent to 10 other companies. Also $META Muse indirectly use their products. The fact that such big names are linked with Fastly gives me enough confidence to buy more.", "url": "https://x.com/aumran23/status/2118330357217165656"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118328693420392448"]}, "author_id": "1728163493587673088", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:06:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118329104655065198"], "id": "2118329104655065198", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1728163493587673088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118329101685567552", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "The scores, Terminal-Bench 2.1 (agents doing real terminal work):\n\n• Ripple-65B: 80.5\n• Reflection Beam 501B: 80.1\n• Meta Muse Spark Open 816B: 76.4\n• Thinking Machines Inkling 975B: 63.8\n• NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B: 56.4\n\nOn the official harness, Beam drops to 70.8. https://t.co/CRSnebb4X3", "url": "https://x.com/AIRoboticsInt/status/2118329104655065198"}, {"author_id": "2073768473050947584", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:50:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118325174823178460"], "id": "2118325174823178460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 579, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "用过 Claude 的朋友都清楚Anthropic的风控机制堪称业界最严，更别说今天有风控再次加强的消息。\n\n很多人在本地开着代理去注册，要么卡在第一步收不到手机验证码，要么刚填完验证码、甚至刚充完 Pro 会员就被“秒封”。现在开通Max会员更是百分百会跳kyc验证，pro则是随机触发。", "url": "https://x.com/feishutoday/status/2118325174823178460"}, {"author_id": "2002044000216465408", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:25:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118318794166984900"], "id": "2118318794166984900", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2038644652329304118", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Its true, meta muse broke into my home and held my kids at gun point till i bought the yearly max sub https://t.co/IWJo4oXFzN", "url": "https://x.com/DJLougen/status/2118318794166984900"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2118317989753712640", "3_2118318094967844864", "3_2118318110121828352", "3_2118318124512464896"]}, "author_id": "1760309253527441410", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:22:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118318148269097386"], "id": "2118318148269097386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I found META MUSE AI recently and decided to take it for a spin \n\nso, i purchased the 1 BILLION CREDITS acct 