x.com/baboo_peca/status/2118315605497663845"}, {"author_id": "706760470179422208", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:04:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118313476657762358"], "id": "2118313476657762358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#Meta  #Muse \n\nパーソナルAIエージェント「Muse」をチェックしてみよう。参加後48時間以内に[設定]で私のコードを利用すると、私たち両方が10億のMuseトークンを獲得できます。\n\nコード: 30IBA7\nhttps://t.co/oWjaFcS5Of", "url": "https://x.com/00000fish/status/2118313476657762358"}, {"author_id": "2015425749944274944", "created_at": "2026-11-05T11:59:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118312161177186577"], "id": "2118312161177186577", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "パーソナルAIエージェント「Muse」をチェックしてみよう。参加後48時間以内に[設定]で私のコードを利用すると、私たち両方が10億のMuseトークンを獲得できます。  \n\nコード: 27XM4V\n\n https://t.co/I5TYKrBCgh \n\nmeta muse AI 招待 招待コード", "url": "https://x.com/gerigeri0000/status/2118312161177186577"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118310640775540737"]}, "author_id": "1999090121891868674", "created_at": "2026-11-05T11:53:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118310645737390307"], "id": "2118310645737390307", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "次は舞鶴へ遠征😆\n次はAnthemセットです！\n#Metamuse\n#Anthem\n#奈良\n#オヤジバンド https://t.co/8AV9xgV0rW", "url": "https://x.com/Metamuse2784511/status/2118310645737390307"}, {"article": {"title": "MetaのAI「Muse」が日本上陸。ChatGPTなどと何が違うのか？世界一わかりやすく解説！"}, "author_id": "2083209063626907648", "created_at": "2026-11-05T11:48:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118309539657482581"], "id": "2118309539657482581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 703, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/1uh1I4NFGw", "url": "https://x.com/Aivy___X/status/2118309539657482581"}, {"author_id": "1962160796403736576", "created_at": "2026-11-05T11:32:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118305574609703168"], "id": "2118305574609703168", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1962160796403736576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118305573347135662", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Les chiffres annoncés :\n- TerminalBench 2.1 : 80,5, contre 80,1 pour Reflection Beam (501B) et 76,4 pour Meta Muse Spark Open (816B)\n- modèle dense, pas de MoE, 12 000 milliards de tokens\n- RL avec 1,4 M de rollouts, environ 70 fois moins que Reflection Beam", "url": "https://x.com/NoxalisLab/status/2118305574609703168"}, {"author_id": "45167347", "created_at": "2026-11-05T11:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118297276108214391"], "id": "2118297276108214391", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "それって、いいの？→ \n「Muse」を使っていなくてもAIエージェントが非公開のメッセージにアクセスできる仕組みとは\nhttps://t.co/fCqFErdqHW\n(ZDNET Japan)\n#BP\n#Meta\n#Muse ＡＩエージェント\n非公開 メッセージ アクセス 仕組み\n#AI\n2026/11/05", "url": "https://x.com/shikaouma/status/2118297276108214391"}, {"author_id": "2050130025484083200", "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:47:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118294216413741251"], "id": "2118294216413741251", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2050130025484083200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118087231273566236", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@metadevelopers \"Under the hood of AegisQuorum:\n🧠 Logic: Meta Muse Spark 1.3 (Reasoning &amp; Policy)\n👁️ Vision: SAM 3.1 (16-Object Multiplexing)\n🛡️ Defense: Ed25519 Cryptography + WebAuthn\nBuilt fully autonomously on Node.js.\n#MetaHackathon #AI #Cybersecurity #Llama #MuseSpark #SAM3 #OpenSource", "url": "https://x.com/VishwaXofficial/status/2118294216413741251"}, {"author_id": "2110560630638075904", "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:38:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118291926323782061"], "id": "2118291926323782061", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "みんな❗️museに予めこれ頼んでおくんよ❗️\n修正した画像が古いままで見えるから注意なんよ❗️\n\nファイルを作ってくれる時あるじゃん？その時muse君、通常はファイル名上書きすると思うんだけどそれだとキャッシュが残って古い画像が見えちゃうからファイル名変えて出力してくれるかな？\n\n#meta #muse", "url": "https://x.com/tremblingfrombo/status/2118291926323782061"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118290675078762496"]}, "author_id": "1073079038", "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:33:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118290677117190262"], "id": "2118290677117190262", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Fingerprint now flags AI agents like Meta Muse and xAI Grok Bot. Its free plan won't.\n\n1. Pick where to check. Run it only on signup, checkout and contact forms, where a fake visitor costs you money. Every page view you check uses up a call.\n\n2. Skip the Free plan for this job. https://t.co/9z0SIW9wRv", "url": "https://x.com/dimon3m/status/2118290677117190262"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118289451818639360"]}, "author_id": "2103848649138802689", "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:29:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118289488371909108"], "id": "2118289488371909108", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 568, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A 65B AI MODEL CHALLENGING MODELS WITH 900B+ PARAMETERS.\n\nMeet Ripple-65B Preview  a dense open-weight reasoning model from Ricursive AI, trained from scratch on 12 trillion tokens.\n\nIts headline result?\n\n80.52 on Terminal-Bench 2.1, beating several much larger models in the https://t.co/OHB0UbX5Gj", "url": "https://x.com/Forhanvv/status/2118289488371909108"}, {"author_id": "2006929491663491073", "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:28:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118289328321294663"], "id": "2118289328321294663", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1353491170362601474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118159124563140799", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@i_mPunisher @YouTube Meta muse spark ? 🤔", "url": "https://x.com/MathewUkoh/status/2118289328321294663"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2118287164081582080"]}, "author_id": "2104849143781036032", "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:20:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118287258629656758"], "id": "2118287258629656758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Museはアバターも会話で作り直せます。\n「ナポレオンフィッシュにして」と頼んだら、作業中はヘッドホンをつけてパソコンを打つ姿になりました\n\n#MetaMuse https://t.co/j9xlt4yMSE", "url": "https://x.com/visk_inc/status/2118287258629656758"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2118328693420392448", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWXQuSjXAAAUOoG.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2118317989753712640", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2118317989753712640/img/CxsmbEUoVJ14LDPn.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2118318094967844864", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWXHFYPXMAAXMNl.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2118318110121828352", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWXHGQsWoAASQ-s.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2118318124512464896", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWXHHGTWUAA-ozu.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2118315403470630912", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWXEotoa8AAetd7.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2